This is a deny-by-default Docker seccomp profile with the namespace operations
required by Chromium's own sandbox. It is not an unconfined profile.

AnyTube modification: allow the chroot syscall without the Docker outer
CAP_SYS_CHROOT condition. Chromium uses it inside its isolated user namespace;
the container and browser workers are not granted host CAP_SYS_CHROOT.
